    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Sunberry Care Center</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunberry Care Center</strong> is a psychological, analog horror adventure horror game with multiple endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon launching the application, you take on the role of a newly hired staff member at Sunberry Care Center, a facility dedicated to the treatment of a rare disease known as Sunberry Syndrome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life at Sunberry Care Center is simple. Your job is to complete routine duties involving facility management and patient care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At Sunberry Care Center, You should...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the blinds open </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the lights on </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Administer injections to patients</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Ignore the patients if they talk to you</span></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, you will earn a wage based on your performance. Save diligently. By the end of the contract you should have enough to start fresh\u2014<i>far away from this wretched facility.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Sunberry Care Center</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunberry Care Center</strong> is a psychological, analog horror adventure horror game with multiple endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon launching the application, you take on the role of a newly hired staff member at Sunberry Care Center, a facility dedicated to the treatment of a rare disease known as Sunberry Syndrome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life at Sunberry Care Center is simple. Your job is to complete routine duties involving facility management and patient care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At Sunberry Care Center, You should...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the blinds open </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the lights on </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Administer injections to patients</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Ignore the patients if they talk to you</span></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, you will earn a wage based on your performance. Save diligently. By the end of the contract you should have enough to start fresh\u2014<i>far away from this wretched facility.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
